    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5977" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cadmī^a</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cadmē^a</span></b> , Paul. ex <i><span class="en">Fest. p.
			47, 10</span></i> Müll.), ae, f., =
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καδμεία</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καδμία</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>an ore of zinc</i>, <i>calamine</i>,
